WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,460 --> 00:00:02,660
Do you see that pile of firewood?

2
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:04,730
Move into the cave, Ma Hao

3
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:06,690
Then go to the west and dig two frames of clay and come back.

4
00:00:07,050 --> 00:00:09,550
Moving firewood and digging soil

5
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:11,150
I'm here to work

6
00:00:11,150 --> 00:00:12,230
Not here to be a winner

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,560
If you don't want to do it, go back

8
00:00:14,960 --> 00:00:15,960
Anyway, I have nothing to do

9
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:35,730
The firewood has been moved, but where is the soil?

10
00:00:36,130 --> 00:00:38,280
Wait for me to take a break

11
00:00:38,480 --> 00:00:39,880
It will be dark when you rest

12
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:42,680
Let’s talk about it first. I won’t care about the work until it’s done.

13
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:53,060
Half a box of firewood is fine, right?

14
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:55,860
It’s also considered that you have worked for half a day today.

15
00:00:56,060 --> 00:00:59,330
half fish

16
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:00,820
I can do it all day
